WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 6824cce803843e78bc605748002706b0

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.220
Habari, karibu tena. Hongera, umefika

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.200
mwisho wa sehemu ya kwanza ya

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.660
kozi hii nzima. Sijui umetumia saa ngapi

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.200
ili kufika hapa, lakini

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.880
nadhani ni nyingi. Natumaini imekuwa ya kufurahisha.

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:13.880
Natumaini imekuwa na manufaa. Natumaini

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.500
unafurahia kupanga programu, na natumaini unataka

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.980
kujifunza zaidi. Hapa ndipo Jiki inaishia kwa

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.580
sasa. Hapa ndipo kozi inamalizikia. Tunaitoa

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.100
kozi hii kwa watu tukitumaini kwamba

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.000
wataipenda, tukitumaini watataka

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.740
zaidi. Kama wewe unataka zaidi, nahitaji

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.940
uniambie. Nahitaji uniandikie

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.900
barua pepe au uandike mahali fulani kwenye mitandao ya kijamii.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.280
Nataka uniambie kwamba

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.340
unaipenda na unataka maudhui zaidi. Na

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.640
watu wa kutosha wakijibu, "Napenda hii,

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.460
nipe zaidi," tutafanya hivyo. Lakini pia

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.160
tunahitaji kuweza kulipa

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.580
bili zetu. Nahitaji kuweza kulipa

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.680
kodi ya nyumba. Na ili hilo liwezekane, tunahitaji watu

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.880
wajiunge na Premium na watoe michango kwa Jiki

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.260
na kwa Exercism, mradi wetu mkubwa zaidi. Kwa hiyo, kama

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.940
umefurahia kozi hii na una uwezo,

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.880
tafadhali fikiria kuchangia pesa kidogo,

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:59.340
kiasi chochote unachoweza, kwa shirika letu lisilo la faida, Exercism,

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.560
na hilo linasaidia kazi zote

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.099
tunazofanya kwenye majukwaa yetu mbalimbali. Natumaini watu

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:07.540
wengi watatuandikia. Natumaini kuna maudhui zaidi

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.420
yanakuja. Na natumaini nitakuona kwenye

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:17.000
video hivi karibuni. Kila la heri. Hadi wakati huo, kwaheri kwa

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:17.200
sasa.
